"系统核心发出一声惨叫：哇—哩—咧—\\n\");        efun::shout(\"系统核心告诉你：要当机了，自己保重吧！\\n\");        log_file(\"static/CRASHES\", MUD_NAME + \" crashed on: \" + ctime(time()) +                 \", error: \" + error + \"\\n\");        if (command_giver)        {                log_file(\"static/CRASHES\",                         sprintf(\"this_player: %O\\n\", command_giver));                cmds = command_giver->query_commands();                for (i = 0; i < sizeof(cmds); i++)                 {                        if (cmds[i][2] == command_giver) continue;                        log_file(\"static/CRASHES\",                                 sprintf(\"%-15s  %2d %O\\n\", cmds[i][0], cmds[i][1], cmds[i][2]));                }                if (environment(command_giver))                        log_file(\"static/CRASHES\",                                  sprintf(\"in where: %s(%s)。\\n\", environment(command_giver)->query(\"short\"),                                         base_name(environment(command_giver))));        }        if (current_object)                log_file(\"static/CRASHES\",                         sprintf( \"this_object: %O\\n\", current_object));#if INSTALL_CRASH_SAVE        lt = localtime(time());        lt[LT_MON]++;        dump_dir = sprintf(DUMP_DIR \"%d-%d-%d/\", lt[LT_YEAR], lt[LT_MON], lt[LT_MDAY]);        foreach (ob in users())        {                reset_eval_cost();                // backup user data to dump                user = geteuid(ob);                if (! stringp(user))                        continue;                flogin = \"login/\" + user[0..0] + \"/\" + user + __SAVE_EXTENSION__;                fuser  = \"user/\"  + user[0..0] + \"/\" + user + __SAVE_EXTENSION__;                if (file_size(DATA_DIR + flogin) > 0 &&                    file_size(DATA_DIR + fuser) > 0)                {                        // exist in data, I will backup it to dump                        assure_file(dump_dir + flogin);                        assure_file(dump_dir + fuser);                        cp(DATA_DIR + flogin, dump_dir + flogin);                        cp(DATA_DIR + fuser,  dump_dir + fuser);                        log_file(\"static/dump\",                                 sprintf(\"backup user(%s) to dump\\n\", user));                }                ob->save();        }#endif}",]),(["author":"心有些乱-linux","title":"to rcwiz","time":1046593559,"msg":"整理的内容格式为例门派               内容名称                     内力上限计算公式武当               太极神功(taiji-shengong)     lvl * lvl * 15 * 18 / 100 / 200; ",]),(["author":"望天涯-rcwiz","title":"to linux","time":1046595983,"msg":"我修了 /feature/attack.c 中的 want_kill(object ob)下的语句将：      if (! userp(ob)) return; 修改为：          if(! ob->is_character())return;[1;37m有问题与我联系 Email:[1;35mprowolf@etang.com [2;37;0m[2;37;0m",]),(["author":"心有些乱-linux","title":"re","time":1046606280,"msg":"最好先修改回来,那个抱错应该不是attack.c的问题",]),(["author":"心有些乱-linux","title":"to rcwiz","time":1046660335,"msg":"我昏，代码居然是只读的怪不得我昨天edit文件不能存盘我已经将全部代码改为可读可写可执行了",]),(["author":"心有些乱-linux","title":"to rcwiz","time":1046669410,"msg":"166             \"/d/foshan/huiguan\"        : \"feng yiming\", /adm/daemons/quest/explore.c你看看这个feng yiming应该不是在这个场景，把场景换一下这种bug一定不要出现，把几个quest的列表对应的npc和房间都检查一次",]),(["author":"心有些乱-linux","title":"to rcwiz","time":1046675120,"msg":"看看furong-jian的pfm居然会出现两次一样的描述//        message_sort(msg, me, target);这行你应该注释",]),(["author":"轩辕行-vin","title":"to rcwiz","time":1046780120,"msg":"怎么回事？[1;33m------------------------------------------[2;37;0m[1;36m几辜花月，屡度星霜。海阔天遥，何处是[2;37;0m[1;37m潇湘[2;37;0m[1;36m？[2;37;0m[2;37;0m",]),(["author":"望天涯-rcwiz","title":"to linux mudos 不能用","time":1046956029,"msg":"换了你给那个mudos后就无法启动了，victor说他还是换回以前那个了，他说错误是：Permission denied ！怎么回事？[1;37m有问题与我联系 Email:[1;35mprowolf@etang.com [2;37;0m[2;37;0m",]),(["author":"望天涯-rcwiz","title":"to linux","time":1047086362,"msg":"你看看mudi